WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 25=

01:40.860 --> 01:41.860
Why didn't you leave just now?

01:43.100 --> 01:44.220
If I'd left,

01:44.740 --> 01:47.020
you would've cursed me
with your dying breath

01:47.700 --> 01:48.540
for being cold and heartless.

01:51.860 --> 01:53.500
I never expected you to stay.

01:55.140 --> 01:55.740
I know.

02:05.980 --> 02:06.860
Come on. I'll carry you.

02:06.940 --> 02:07.500
No need.

02:08.300 --> 02:09.100
It's just the two of us.

02:09.340 --> 02:10.620
If we head deeper into the woods

02:11.260 --> 02:12.260
and Qiu Shuo's men surround us,

02:12.820 --> 02:13.660
we'll be in even greater danger.

02:17.060 --> 02:17.660
You're right.

02:18.620 --> 02:20.140
He might make us disappear
without a trace,

02:20.980 --> 02:22.300
then claim we fled to escape punishment

02:23.020 --> 02:23.660
and vanished.

02:29.460 --> 02:30.140
Give me the signal flare.

02:41.100 --> 02:41.660
Are you insane?

02:41.900 --> 02:42.380
Don't light it!

02:42.780 --> 02:44.980
I made an agreement with Lu Yan,
General of the Left Jinwu Guard.

02:45.580 --> 02:46.660
He promised to help me
defeat the traitors.

02:47.660 --> 02:48.420
If he's willing

02:48.740 --> 02:49.580
to ride to our aid tonight,

02:49.820 --> 02:50.740
we'll have reinforcements.

02:52.420 --> 02:53.180
I just hope

02:53.780 --> 02:55.060
he doesn't turn out like Mu Xianqing.

02:55.620 --> 02:56.740
But if we send up the signal,

02:57.180 --> 02:58.220
the Jinwu Guards won't be the only ones
to see it.

02:58.660 --> 02:59.620
Qiu Shuo will spot it too!

03:00.100 --> 03:01.180
Even if we don't,

03:01.820 --> 03:03.060
Qiu Shuo will find us sooner or later.

03:03.060 --> 03:04.980
Even if Lu Yan keeps his promise,

03:05.580 --> 03:06.620
he's far beyond the hunting grounds,

03:07.100 --> 03:08.220
while Qiu Shuo is right nearby.

03:08.460 --> 03:10.420
If the Jinwu Guards arrive
after Qiu Shuo,

03:10.940 --> 03:11.940
we're dead anyway.

03:13.220 --> 03:14.500
There's one more possibility.

03:15.780 --> 03:16.660
If the Jinwu Guards

03:17.500 --> 03:18.500
get here before Qiu Shuo,

03:19.100 --> 03:19.980
we'll be saved.

03:21.740 --> 03:23.380
How is that even possible?

03:24.900 --> 03:26.300
Even if the odds are slim

03:27.220 --> 03:28.220
and we're almost certain to die,

03:29.500 --> 03:30.260
so what?

03:31.060 --> 03:32.140
As long as there's a chance,

03:32.580 --> 03:33.540
we have to take it.

03:41.780 --> 03:42.380
All right, then.

03:43.300 --> 03:44.340
Tonight, I, Yang Si,

03:44.740 --> 03:46.100
risked my life to stand by you.

03:47.140 --> 03:48.460
I've already put my neck on the line.

03:50.740 --> 03:51.500
Might as well

03:52.580 --> 03:53.740
take one more gamble with you!

04:05.340 --> 04:06.660
So that's where they are!

04:07.180 --> 04:07.500
Move!

04:10.380 --> 04:10.820
General Lu,

04:11.220 --> 04:12.220
whoever sent up that signal

04:12.340 --> 04:13.180
should be a few miles away.

04:13.420 --> 04:14.060
Shall we move out?

04:29.820 --> 04:30.260
Mu Xun.

04:33.220 --> 04:34.380
Your heart is pounding.

04:35.780 --> 04:36.660
I can hear it.

04:39.660 --> 04:40.140
Really?

04:44.980 --> 04:45.700
Stay alert!

04:46.100 --> 04:47.140
You guys, go that way!

04:47.300 --> 04:47.740
Yes, sir!

04:47.940 --> 04:48.620
The rest of you, follow me!

04:48.900 --> 04:49.260
Yes, sir!

04:50.580 --> 04:50.900
Come on!

05:08.820 --> 05:10.020
So it ends the same way after all.

05:13.660 --> 05:16.220
Making an ally of someone
like Mu Xianqing...

05:17.380 --> 05:19.540
Weren't you afraid he'd turn on you?

05:24.780 --> 05:25.660
I'm sorry, Yang Si.

05:26.860 --> 05:27.940
I'll get you killed this time.

05:29.900 --> 05:31.500
Better to die fighting in righteous fury

05:32.580 --> 05:34.140
than live in disgrace
under that treacherous eunuch.

05:36.020 --> 05:36.460
Your Royal Highness,

05:37.260 --> 05:38.340
you asked me ten years ago,

05:39.180 --> 05:41.100
and I said I'd always stand by your side

05:42.060 --> 05:42.940
until my very last breath.

05:43.740 --> 05:44.540
That hasn't changed.

05:47.820 --> 05:48.740
Then let's fight them together.

05:52.740 --> 05:53.820
The Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

05:54.460 --> 05:54.980
has plotted

05:55.460 --> 05:56.620
to seize the throne before his time,

05:56.980 --> 05:58.060
murder his father, and rebel!

05:58.820 --> 06:00.900
Yang Si of the Court of Judicial Review
is his lackey,

06:01.300 --> 06:02.180
guilty of high treason!

06:02.580 --> 06:03.540
Seize them both!

06:05.540 --> 06:06.620
Kill them on sight!

06:07.580 --> 06:08.020
Yes, sir!

06:33.380 --> 06:34.420
General Meng.

06:35.540 --> 06:36.500
I never thought

06:37.060 --> 06:39.340
you'd get mixed up in this mess too!

06:40.500 --> 06:41.180
These are your men?

06:42.940 --> 06:43.900
What are you doing, General Meng?

06:45.220 --> 06:46.380
I wonder if Your Royal Highness

06:47.260 --> 06:48.500
has any regrets now.

06:49.540 --> 06:50.740
Why bother with Mu Xianqing?

06:51.300 --> 06:52.340
You should've come to me!

06:56.980 --> 06:58.140
Yan Shang? What are you doing here?

06:58.820 --> 07:00.140
Quick! Get out of here!

07:00.620 --> 07:01.620
I'll explain everything later.

07:01.660 --> 07:02.300
But what about here?

07:03.460 --> 07:04.300
Get the Crown Prince to safety!

07:04.580 --> 07:05.340
I'll deal with my friends here!

07:05.340 --> 07:06.420
Come on! Leave it to him!

07:16.300 --> 07:18.100
I saw Mu Xianqing's body just now.

07:19.820 --> 07:20.300
Thank you.

07:21.020 --> 07:22.500
I killed him for Lord Yu.

07:23.420 --> 07:24.300
It had nothing to do with you.

07:25.220 --> 07:25.700
Qiu Shuo,

07:26.460 --> 07:27.660
I've rarely respected anyone in my life.

07:28.460 --> 07:29.700
You're a true hero of our time.

07:30.180 --> 07:31.380
Why be that eunuch's lapdog?

07:31.500 --> 07:32.020
Shut up!

07:33.180 --> 07:35.340
Lord Yu recognized my worth
and gave me my chance.

07:36.220 --> 07:38.260
He cared for my parents in life
and buried them in death.

07:39.180 --> 07:40.420
For ten years of fighting rebellions,

07:41.300 --> 07:43.460
I've risked my life fighting
by his side.

07:45.700 --> 07:46.540
But you...

07:47.300 --> 07:49.460
You killed your lord
in the Central Circuit and seized power!

07:49.860 --> 07:51.700
I am nothing like you!

07:52.460 --> 07:53.260
I would never

07:53.780 --> 07:55.380
betray my lord!

08:43.460 --> 08:44.700
Now Meng's getting involved too.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.420
He can't seriously want
to be your brother-in-law, can he?

08:48.060 --> 08:48.660
Yang Si,

08:49.340 --> 08:50.180
give it a rest.

08:50.580 --> 08:51.340
Stop talking nonsense.

08:51.340 --> 08:52.540
Your Royal Highness, your wound...

08:55.700 --> 08:56.220
I hear something.

09:00.540 --> 09:01.300
Hoofbeats.

09:12.060 --> 09:13.380
(Lu Yan,
General of the Left Jinwu Guard)

09:13.380 --> 09:14.860
I am Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard.

09:15.060 --> 09:15.780
Forgive my late arrival

09:16.020 --> 09:17.300
to rescue you, Your Royal Highness.

09:20.300 --> 09:21.340
Lu Yan, hear my orders.

09:21.940 --> 09:22.980
Join me in a counterattack

09:23.580 --> 09:24.660
and kill the treacherous eunuch!

09:26.020 --> 09:26.340
Yes!

09:34.380 --> 09:35.020
What time is it?

09:35.780 --> 09:36.900
It's already past the hour of Chou.

09:38.500 --> 09:39.220
It's taken far too long.

09:39.780 --> 09:40.580
Qiu Shuo is in grave danger.

09:41.020 --> 09:41.500
Sir,

09:42.660 --> 09:43.740
we must act quickly.

09:47.100 --> 09:47.740
Send word

09:48.140 --> 09:48.900
to the Shence Army.

09:49.140 --> 09:50.220
Have them enter the hunting grounds
early as reinforcements.

09:51.100 --> 09:51.420
Yes.

10:00.420 --> 10:00.860
Wenji.

10:02.980 --> 10:04.380
There's likely to be chaos here.

10:04.900 --> 10:06.100
Keep a close eye on His Majesty

10:06.860 --> 10:07.580
and that woman for me.

10:08.540 --> 10:09.500
Don't disappoint me.

10:11.620 --> 10:11.940
Yes.

10:39.260 --> 10:39.660
Yang Si,

10:40.180 --> 10:41.260
once we're inside, attack immediately.

10:41.580 --> 10:42.300
End it quickly.

10:43.020 --> 10:44.220
Don't give Yu Cheng'an
a chance to speak,

10:44.380 --> 10:45.300
or he'll pull the same trick again.

10:45.580 --> 10:45.980
Understood!

10:49.620 --> 10:49.940
Don't be afraid.

10:52.300 --> 10:52.780
Wenji,

10:54.420 --> 10:55.540
why did Lord Yu have me captured?

10:57.180 --> 10:58.420
Why is His Majesty here?

11:02.220 --> 11:03.260
Am I going to die?

11:03.500 --> 11:04.220
Don't ask any questions.

11:13.860 --> 11:14.220
Chunhua!

11:15.300 --> 11:15.700
Chunhua!

11:27.300 --> 11:28.300
(Huai)

11:33.460 --> 11:33.940
Yu Cheng'an

11:34.580 --> 11:35.460
has seized control of the government

11:35.700 --> 11:36.460
and committed countless abuses!

11:37.180 --> 11:38.620
Now he even dares to frame
the Crown Prince!

11:38.900 --> 11:39.660
His crimes are unforgivable!

11:40.540 --> 11:42.060
Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard,
hear my orders!

11:43.380 --> 11:44.580
Storm the temporary imperial palace
with me

11:45.340 --> 11:46.140
and wipe out the traitor!

11:47.940 --> 11:49.100
How dare you, Lu Yan.

11:49.660 --> 11:50.900
You dare storm here?

11:51.140 --> 11:52.900
Are you conspiring with the Crown Prince

11:53.340 --> 11:54.300
to commit treason?

11:54.700 --> 11:55.460
Treason?

11:57.740 --> 11:59.020
General Lu, don't waste your breath
on him.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.620
His Majesty is resting inside.

12:02.060 --> 12:02.980
General Lu,

12:03.420 --> 12:04.300
what do you intend to do?

12:04.860 --> 12:05.420
What?

12:07.300 --> 12:09.140
Isn't His Majesty at Taiji Palace?

12:11.380 --> 12:12.740
Where His Majesty is,

12:13.180 --> 12:13.940
surely the Crown Prince

12:14.660 --> 12:15.860
knows perfectly well.

12:17.300 --> 12:20.020
The Crown Prince and Mr. Yang
both saw him earlier.

12:20.420 --> 12:20.940
His Majesty

12:21.580 --> 12:22.940
is right here.

12:23.540 --> 12:25.500
Yet you dare lead troops inside

12:25.500 --> 12:26.780
and plot against the Emperor!

12:27.260 --> 12:28.820
Aren't you afraid your entire clan
will be executed?

12:34.820 --> 12:35.340
Your Royal Highness,

12:35.900 --> 12:36.940
is that true?

13:04.300 --> 13:04.780
Wenji.

13:05.340 --> 13:05.820
Wenji.

13:06.140 --> 13:06.620
Chunhua.

13:08.020 --> 13:08.500
I'm right here.

13:09.940 --> 13:10.500
I'm here with you.

13:16.100 --> 13:17.220
Utter nonsense!

13:21.660 --> 13:23.540
Every official knows
His Majesty is unwell.

13:24.340 --> 13:26.140
He hasn't appeared in public
since the birthday banquet.

13:26.220 --> 13:27.700
He's been recovering at Taiji Palace.

13:28.380 --> 13:29.460
Even this winter hunt

13:29.820 --> 13:32.300
was entrusted entirely to Lord Yu
by His Majesty.

13:32.740 --> 13:35.140
His Majesty personally granted Lord Yu
use of the temporary imperial palace.

13:35.780 --> 13:36.540
Everyone knows that.

13:37.300 --> 13:38.340
The only person

13:38.620 --> 13:40.180
staying here is Lord Yu.

13:41.020 --> 13:41.940
How could His Majesty be here?

13:42.180 --> 13:43.380
Lord Yu is indeed here.

13:44.300 --> 13:45.140
But so

13:45.940 --> 13:46.500
is His Majesty.

13:49.540 --> 13:50.060
Is that so?

13:51.580 --> 13:53.540
But Sheng'an's over 50 li away.

13:54.100 --> 13:55.700
It's hardly a short walk.

13:56.500 --> 13:58.180
If His Majesty really traveled
to the hunting grounds,

13:58.900 --> 13:59.660
surely someone along the way

14:00.420 --> 14:02.500
would've seen his imperial procession.

14:02.780 --> 14:04.540
His Majesty traveled
with a small escort,

14:05.420 --> 14:06.540
disguised as a commoner.

14:06.980 --> 14:08.100
All the court officials are here.

14:08.900 --> 14:10.660
The Crown Prince and Princess are here.

14:11.020 --> 14:12.740
Even the military governors
of two Circuits are here.

14:13.300 --> 14:15.220
Yet the Emperor alone came in disguise?

14:15.500 --> 14:16.500
General Lu,

14:17.220 --> 14:18.140
does that sound believable to you?

14:27.900 --> 14:28.580
The Crown Prince

14:29.060 --> 14:29.700
and Yang Si

14:30.580 --> 14:32.820
stormed the temporary imperial palace
hours ago and threatened His Majesty,

14:32.820 --> 14:34.260
committing an act of high treason.

14:35.220 --> 14:37.020
Lord Yu ordered us to defend
the Emperor with our lives.

14:37.180 --> 14:38.540
That's the only reason
their plot failed.

14:39.260 --> 14:40.900
But after they escaped,

14:40.940 --> 14:42.820
they somehow tricked General Lu
into coming here.

14:43.860 --> 14:45.700
What kind of position

14:46.140 --> 14:47.140
are they putting General Lu in?

14:58.260 --> 14:58.740
Your Royal Highness,

14:59.540 --> 15:00.140
Mr. Yang,

15:01.700 --> 15:02.860
you told me

15:02.940 --> 15:04.580
that the person you saw

15:04.700 --> 15:05.700
inside the temporary imperial palace
wasn't His Majesty.

15:06.300 --> 15:07.100
Is that true?

15:16.780 --> 15:17.260
That's right.

15:18.340 --> 15:18.980
My father

15:19.940 --> 15:21.300
never came to the hunting grounds!

15:22.220 --> 15:23.820
That treacherous Yu Cheng'an
had the nerve

15:24.180 --> 15:26.100
to plant a double in
the temporary imperial palace

15:26.540 --> 15:27.620
and frame me for treason!

15:29.020 --> 15:29.540
That man

15:30.340 --> 15:31.620
looks and sounds

15:31.940 --> 15:33.020
just like my father.

15:34.180 --> 15:34.740
But

15:35.060 --> 15:36.980
as his son, I know what I saw.

15:37.380 --> 15:39.580
He is a double!

15:44.020 --> 15:44.980
Your Royal Highness,

15:45.540 --> 15:47.020
there can be only one ruler,

15:47.820 --> 15:49.580
but why are you in such a hurry
to take his place?

15:50.220 --> 15:51.540
His Majesty has retired for the night.

15:52.180 --> 15:54.060
Lord Yu and I didn't wish
to disturb him.

15:54.700 --> 15:56.060
But given the circumstances,

15:56.740 --> 15:58.660
we may have no choice
but to request His Majesty's presence

15:58.980 --> 15:59.980
and let General Lu

16:00.460 --> 16:01.660
see for himself.

16:03.460 --> 16:03.900
Chunhua,

16:04.460 --> 16:05.140
I don't care about anyone else.

16:06.020 --> 16:06.820
You have to stay alive.

16:17.020 --> 16:17.540
Wenji!

16:18.180 --> 16:18.780
Wenji!

16:20.260 --> 16:20.740
Wenji!

16:28.340 --> 16:28.780
Chunhua,

16:30.420 --> 16:31.060
you must survive.

16:31.980 --> 16:32.900
Your baby must survive too.

17:04.260 --> 17:05.580
I am Princess Danyang!

17:08.820 --> 17:10.220
I have His Majesty's written decree!

17:34.660 --> 17:35.580
Princess Danyang,

17:36.340 --> 17:37.460
how can you prove

17:37.700 --> 17:38.780
the decree is genuine?

17:40.540 --> 17:41.460
I met with His Majesty

17:42.580 --> 17:43.500
and brought back his decree.

17:44.020 --> 17:45.740
Every city gate and palace gate
I passed through

17:46.060 --> 17:46.820
has a record of my passage.

17:47.540 --> 17:48.340
How could it be fake?

17:54.060 --> 17:54.420
Your Highness,

17:55.140 --> 17:56.100
aren't we heading straight back
to the hunting grounds?

17:56.460 --> 17:57.260
To my residence first!

18:13.340 --> 18:15.580
(By imperial command: Meng Baiyu
has shown virtue and loyalty.)

18:15.580 --> 18:17.960
(Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang,
is gentle, virtuous, and well-mannered.)

18:17.960 --> 18:20.660
(I hereby decree her marriage
into the Meng family. May they prosper.)

18:20.660 --> 18:23.240
(May they enjoy marital harmony.
Let this decree be carried out.)

18:29.940 --> 18:31.140
General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

18:31.700 --> 18:32.140
Lu Yan,

18:32.860 --> 18:33.340
receive the imperial decree!

18:34.580 --> 18:34.900
At your command!

18:37.700 --> 18:38.700
"Since Yu became one
of the Three Excellencies,

18:39.300 --> 18:40.140
the wilds hold starved corpses,

18:40.900 --> 18:41.780
our nation has suffered
countless calamities,

18:42.260 --> 18:43.140
and countless families have wept,

18:43.860 --> 18:44.700
while one man alone enjoys
power and glory.

18:45.740 --> 18:47.180
I entrusted Huai to the Yu family

18:47.740 --> 18:48.700
and made a terrible mistake.

18:49.220 --> 18:50.220
Now I must set things right.

18:50.660 --> 18:52.980
The Jinwu Guard shall aid
the Crown Prince in slaying this traitor

18:53.820 --> 18:54.860
and saving our people.

18:55.260 --> 18:56.860
Those who charge forward shall receive
a hundred strings of coins.

18:57.540 --> 18:58.180
Whoever takes the traitor's head

18:58.540 --> 18:59.620
shall be granted the title
of Marquis for military merit!"

19:00.860 --> 19:01.780
Princess Danyang,

19:02.620 --> 19:03.260
forging an imperial decree

19:03.820 --> 19:05.100
is punishable by death.

19:06.900 --> 19:07.940
Those who follow her

19:08.980 --> 19:10.540
will have their entire clans executed!

19:13.580 --> 19:16.060
The Princess received this decree
at Taiji Palace,

19:16.380 --> 19:18.420
directly from His Majesty himself.

19:18.900 --> 19:21.340
Even if you bring out a double

19:22.180 --> 19:23.300
and manage to fool everyone else,

19:24.220 --> 19:26.700
how could you fool the Crown Prince
and Princess?

19:28.780 --> 19:29.700
An hour ago,

19:30.340 --> 19:31.660
my father was at Taiji Palace,

19:31.940 --> 19:33.100
giving me this decree in person.

19:33.620 --> 19:34.820
He's been ill for a long time.

19:35.100 --> 19:36.300
Even as he affixed the imperial seal,

19:36.660 --> 19:37.500
he was coughing and struggling
to breathe.

19:38.460 --> 19:39.420
How could he possibly travel

19:39.700 --> 19:40.980
all the way to this
temporary imperial palace?

19:43.540 --> 19:44.100
General Lu,

19:45.220 --> 19:46.780
the Crown Prince and Princess of Huai

19:47.420 --> 19:48.900
stand before you
with His Majesty's decree.

19:49.620 --> 19:50.420
Will you believe us,

19:51.300 --> 19:53.180
or these traitors who have no proof
at all?

19:59.100 --> 20:00.020
Princess Danyang,

20:00.420 --> 20:01.580
I'll claim the first victory!

20:11.060 --> 20:11.540
Catch!

20:22.260 --> 20:23.420
Qiu Shuo is dead.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.140
His Majesty's decree is before us.

20:28.780 --> 20:30.460
The Jinwu Guard shall obey
His Majesty's commands

20:30.740 --> 20:31.940
and fight these treacherous rebels!

20:32.340 --> 20:33.140
It is our duty!

20:36.020 --> 20:36.540
General Lu!

20:36.700 --> 20:37.220
General Meng!

20:37.940 --> 20:39.540
We must strike against
that traitor Yu immediately!

20:40.460 --> 20:40.940
Charge!

20:56.580 --> 20:57.100
Sir.

20:58.180 --> 20:59.260
The Shence Army hasn't arrived.

21:00.540 --> 21:01.740
We can't stay here any longer.

21:51.020 --> 21:51.380
Lord Yu.

21:52.260 --> 21:52.660
Lord Yu.

21:53.940 --> 21:54.420
Just now,

21:54.980 --> 21:55.940
Prince of Jin's secondary consort
labored prematurely.

21:56.540 --> 21:57.100
and gave birth.

22:04.780 --> 22:06.220
This is Huai's new heir to the throne.

22:08.820 --> 22:09.140
Let's go.

22:11.340 --> 22:11.700
Godfather,

22:13.340 --> 22:14.220
what about that woman?

22:14.460 --> 22:15.100
What should we do with her?

22:20.940 --> 22:21.340
Lord Yu.

22:28.780 --> 22:29.580
A baby this young

22:30.340 --> 22:31.460
may not survive

22:31.940 --> 22:32.620
without its mother.

22:32.900 --> 22:33.300
Bring them both.

22:33.580 --> 22:33.860
Yes.

23:03.940 --> 23:04.380
You two,

23:05.460 --> 23:06.900
do you still have the daggers

23:07.180 --> 23:07.780
I gave you earlier?

23:11.060 --> 23:12.020
The man on the bed...

23:12.540 --> 23:13.780
I'll leave him to you.

23:20.140 --> 23:21.940
Didn't you hear what they said outside?

23:22.100 --> 23:23.580
That man is just a double,

23:23.660 --> 23:24.580
not the real emperor.

23:24.620 --> 23:25.220
What are you afraid of?

23:31.140 --> 23:31.900
Rest assured, Mr. Wei.

23:32.260 --> 23:32.700
I...

23:33.420 --> 23:34.420
am willing to see this through.

23:49.060 --> 23:49.820
You came back after all.

23:50.420 --> 23:51.180
If I hadn't,

23:51.700 --> 23:52.780
how would you have gotten out of that?

23:53.460 --> 23:54.700
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

23:55.260 --> 23:56.900
I had to claim only a double
was at the temporary imperial palace.

23:57.340 --> 23:59.100
It was the only way to give Huai
and His Majesty a chance to survive.

23:59.340 --> 24:00.100
You're right.

24:07.820 --> 24:08.380
Father!

24:19.340 --> 24:19.860
Lord Yu,

24:20.620 --> 24:21.620
it's all taken care of.

24:23.140 --> 24:24.300
Wang Qing went weak
at the sight of blood

24:24.820 --> 24:25.740
and is still lying on the floor inside.

24:29.860 --> 24:30.220
Lord Yu,

24:30.780 --> 24:31.420
I'm a skilled rider.

24:31.740 --> 24:32.540
I can ride with one hand.

24:33.060 --> 24:34.060
Please let me carry the heir.

24:35.540 --> 24:35.900
All right.

24:43.620 --> 24:44.980
The Shence Army will meet us
to the east.

24:45.580 --> 24:46.900
Follow me. We'll join them there.

25:19.740 --> 25:20.140
Father!

25:30.620 --> 25:31.140
I'm fine.

25:31.140 --> 25:31.540
Father!

25:32.980 --> 25:33.420
Father!

25:34.780 --> 25:35.380
We're safe now.

25:36.820 --> 25:37.580
Thank goodness!

25:38.700 --> 25:39.300
Father.

25:41.820 --> 25:43.260
Yan Shang pays his respects
to Your Majesty.

25:56.180 --> 25:56.660
Father.

26:40.140 --> 26:40.500
Move aside!

26:51.500 --> 26:52.180
How dare you!

26:53.820 --> 26:54.620
Guards!

26:54.980 --> 26:55.460
Come on!

26:55.780 --> 26:57.580
Someone! Get in here!

26:58.980 --> 27:00.620
Help!

28:07.260 --> 28:07.980
I'll go get her!

28:11.060 --> 28:11.820
Go! Sir, hurry!

28:15.660 --> 28:16.060
Chunhua!

28:22.100 --> 28:22.420
Go!

28:43.340 --> 28:43.780
Chunhua!

28:44.940 --> 28:45.340
Chunhua!

28:46.860 --> 28:47.140
Come on!

28:47.420 --> 28:47.900
Wenji...

28:48.740 --> 28:49.660
I can't run anymore.

28:50.900 --> 28:51.540
Go without me.

28:51.540 --> 28:51.940
No.

28:55.260 --> 28:55.900
Search over there!

28:56.340 --> 28:56.780
- Hurry!
- Yes, sir!

28:59.380 --> 28:59.860
After them!

29:03.020 --> 29:03.940
Search every inch!

29:04.180 --> 29:04.820
Look carefully!

29:05.380 --> 29:06.260
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

29:44.260 --> 29:44.660
Chunhua.

29:45.780 --> 29:46.220
Chunhua.

29:47.300 --> 29:47.740
Chunhua.

29:52.540 --> 29:53.060
It's all right now.

29:54.300 --> 29:55.180
We're safe, Chunhua.

29:56.580 --> 29:57.380
We're still alive.

29:57.700 --> 29:58.900
And so is the baby.

30:36.580 --> 30:36.940
Zidu!

30:38.900 --> 30:39.460
Zidu, hurry!

30:40.060 --> 30:40.380
Get on the horse!

30:41.660 --> 30:41.980
Quick!

31:07.500 --> 31:08.140
This is

31:08.980 --> 31:10.500
as far as I can go with you.

31:36.580 --> 31:37.020
Wenji.

31:39.700 --> 31:40.700
What do we do now?

31:45.340 --> 31:45.660
Wait.

31:47.780 --> 31:48.300
Wait for what?

31:48.940 --> 31:49.700
For dawn.

31:51.940 --> 31:52.940
Until the losers are branded traitors.

32:03.980 --> 32:05.140
Why is the baby so wrinkly?

32:05.740 --> 32:06.580
Kind of ugly, actually.

32:13.220 --> 32:13.500
No.

32:15.980 --> 32:16.540
Adorable.

32:21.100 --> 32:21.460
Just like you.

32:30.780 --> 32:31.260
Wenji,

32:33.460 --> 32:34.420
I can't remember

32:35.700 --> 32:36.980
the last time

32:37.860 --> 32:38.700
I felt this happy.

32:54.580 --> 32:55.140
Tell me,

32:55.860 --> 32:56.660
when morning comes,

32:57.340 --> 32:57.900
where should we go?

32:59.460 --> 32:59.900
Where?

33:00.780 --> 33:02.020
I'd love to go back to Lingnan.

33:04.180 --> 33:06.340
To that little hillside
where we first met.

33:07.740 --> 33:08.660
Lingnan is so warm.

33:10.260 --> 33:10.940
And full of flowers.

33:12.660 --> 33:13.260
I love it there.

33:22.060 --> 33:22.420
All right.

33:24.860 --> 33:25.540
When we get there,

33:28.340 --> 33:29.300
I'll lead your horse for you again.

33:32.780 --> 33:34.540
Then let's settle down
in a little village.

33:35.460 --> 33:36.420
Somewhere no one knows me,

33:37.140 --> 33:38.180
and no one knows you.

33:40.340 --> 33:43.780
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

33:44.660 --> 33:45.660
We'll find a place

33:46.780 --> 33:47.500
with mountains

33:49.140 --> 33:50.300
and streams.

33:50.300 --> 33:51.980
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

33:51.980 --> 33:53.020
We'll raise a few chickens and ducks.

33:54.540 --> 33:55.260
And out front,

33:56.620 --> 33:58.900
we'll plant some
of your favorite flowers.

34:00.140 --> 34:01.100
But I don't know how to raise
chickens or ducks.

34:01.380 --> 34:02.180
Or grow flowers.

34:02.180 --> 34:04.660
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

34:04.660 --> 34:04.980
That's okay.

34:06.020 --> 34:06.700
I'll take care of everything.

34:06.700 --> 34:09.380
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

34:09.420 --> 34:14.060
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

34:15.260 --> 34:19.000
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

34:19.000 --> 34:22.820
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

34:22.900 --> 34:25.300
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

34:25.420 --> 34:27.700
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

34:27.940 --> 34:31.580
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

34:31.700 --> 34:35.500
♪Ask not why longing has no end;
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

34:35.500 --> 34:39.380
♪Ask not why longing has no end;
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

34:39.620 --> 34:41.780
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

34:41.860 --> 34:43.860
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

34:43.940 --> 34:48.060
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

34:48.060 --> 34:48.940
Is it almost dawn?

34:58.780 --> 35:00.460
I wish the sun would never rise.

35:19.180 --> 35:19.860
Everyone, over here!

35:25.740 --> 35:26.420
Who are you people?

35:29.380 --> 35:29.740
Take them away!

35:30.180 --> 35:30.540
Yes, sir!

35:32.540 --> 35:33.060
Chunhua!

35:41.140 --> 35:42.020
What a night!

35:42.620 --> 35:43.700
I'm completely exhausted.

35:47.100 --> 35:48.220
General Meng, it seems you've

35:48.740 --> 35:50.260
joined forces with the Crown Prince.

35:51.900 --> 35:52.980
Take me as a warning.

35:53.660 --> 35:56.020
The Mus' rule is rotten to the core.

35:57.060 --> 35:58.980
If you devote your life
to serving the Mu family,

35:59.540 --> 36:01.700
they'll dispose of you
once you've served your purpose.

36:03.940 --> 36:04.500
So?

36:05.300 --> 36:06.660
What I'm saying is,

36:08.820 --> 36:09.540
the Meng family of North Jing

36:10.700 --> 36:12.180
has produced heroes for generations.

36:13.180 --> 36:14.460
Surely you don't intend

36:14.820 --> 36:16.420
to spend your whole life

36:16.420 --> 36:18.580
as a mere military governor
of the Central Circuit?

36:20.980 --> 36:22.100
The Meng family's

36:22.380 --> 36:24.060
cavalry is unstoppable.

36:24.900 --> 36:27.660
And I command Huai's Shence Army,

36:28.020 --> 36:29.660
all 100,000 of its soldiers.

36:30.020 --> 36:31.380
If we join forces,

36:32.100 --> 36:35.300
we could put a whole new dynasty
on the throne.

36:37.580 --> 36:38.220
Right.

36:40.940 --> 36:41.460
Lord Yu.

36:43.020 --> 36:44.740
But you're just stalling for time.

36:47.220 --> 36:48.220
What's with all the talk?

36:49.620 --> 36:49.940
Where's the deer?

36:50.380 --> 36:50.900
What deer?

36:51.180 --> 36:52.620
I came here to hunt the deer.

36:53.180 --> 36:54.260
Hunt the deer?

36:57.380 --> 37:00.660
Who would actually come here
just to hunt a deer?

37:04.620 --> 37:06.780
You sent this scout to call
for reinforcements, didn't you?

37:07.660 --> 37:08.900
He's quite the fast runner.

37:10.540 --> 37:11.340
Just one step away.

37:11.860 --> 37:14.660
He almost made it
into the Shence Army's camp.

37:19.100 --> 37:19.420
Good.

37:20.900 --> 37:21.540
Very good.

37:24.460 --> 37:25.420
You care nothing for the throne,

37:26.060 --> 37:27.220
only for the woman you love.

37:28.660 --> 37:28.940
Good.

37:29.900 --> 37:30.300
Very good.

37:35.620 --> 37:36.540
To lose

37:37.820 --> 37:40.420
to a man as sincere and devoted as you,

37:41.540 --> 37:41.980
I have no regrets.

37:47.540 --> 37:48.900
If you'd just let me catch
that deer sooner,

37:50.980 --> 37:52.020
none of this would've happened.

38:05.300 --> 38:12.200
(Yuhua Palace, Yu)

38:42.700 --> 38:49.660
(Yu)

38:54.820 --> 38:55.140
General!

38:55.380 --> 38:56.620
We've searched the entire
temporary imperial palace.

38:56.780 --> 38:58.060
None of Yu's remaining
followers survived.

38:58.540 --> 38:59.100
Withdraw the troops.

39:00.420 --> 39:01.860
But Princess Danyang is still inside.

39:20.300 --> 39:26.460
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

39:26.820 --> 39:32.980
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

39:34.460 --> 39:40.620
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

39:41.140 --> 39:44.860
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

39:44.860 --> 39:48.340
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

39:48.980 --> 39:52.520
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

39:52.520 --> 39:56.060
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

39:56.180 --> 39:59.600
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

39:59.600 --> 40:03.340
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

40:04.420 --> 40:05.140
You're free.

40:05.140 --> 40:07.780
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

40:07.860 --> 40:10.380
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

40:10.540 --> 40:14.060
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

40:14.380 --> 40:17.900
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

40:17.940 --> 40:22.180
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

40:22.660 --> 40:23.460
You're free.

40:23.460 --> 40:24.900
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

40:24.900 --> 40:28.020
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

40:28.140 --> 40:31.260
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

40:31.940 --> 40:36.020
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

40:36.500 --> 40:39.300
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

40:39.340 --> 40:45.580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

40:46.220 --> 40:50.020
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

40:50.220 --> 40:53.180
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

40:53.500 --> 40:57.160
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

40:57.340 --> 41:01.420
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

41:01.420 --> 41:05.700
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

41:06.460 --> 41:09.860
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

41:11.140 --> 41:15.240
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

41:15.240 --> 41:19.660
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

41:20.260 --> 41:23.900
♪Not another tear shall fall♪

41:23.900 --> 41:24.740
Hurry! Take everything away!

41:29.460 --> 41:29.940
I'll take that.

41:44.860 --> 41:46.660
Princess Danyang has arrived!

41:57.860 --> 41:58.340
Chunhua!

42:05.620 --> 42:06.140
Your Highness.

42:08.180 --> 42:08.780
Are you all right?

42:11.060 --> 42:11.620
I'm fine.

42:23.140 --> 42:23.620
Wenji.

42:47.660 --> 42:48.220
You may leave.

43:02.100 --> 43:06.820
(Huai)

43:06.820 --> 43:07.140
Shang.

43:10.340 --> 43:11.300
You're the one who saved His Majesty?

43:12.060 --> 43:13.220
(Huai)
Liu Wenji, you've really...

43:14.460 --> 43:15.540
got some nerve.

43:16.540 --> 43:18.580
How dare you pull that off
right under Yu Cheng'an's nose?

43:24.340 --> 43:24.940
Actually,

43:26.540 --> 43:27.580
I had a lot on my mind at the time.

43:30.260 --> 43:31.260
But then I thought,

43:32.740 --> 43:34.220
I couldn't let Yu Cheng'an
win like that.

43:35.420 --> 43:36.100
Whether it's Chunhua

43:36.660 --> 43:37.260
or her child,

43:37.980 --> 43:38.780
in his eyes,

43:40.260 --> 43:41.900
they're nothing but tools he can destroy

43:42.380 --> 43:43.220
or throw away at any moment.

43:45.660 --> 43:49.180
(Huai)

43:49.180 --> 43:50.060
I wanted to give Chunhua and her baby

43:50.940 --> 43:51.500
a chance to live.

43:56.100 --> 43:56.660
Wenji,

43:57.700 --> 43:58.380
that's just like you!

44:05.900 --> 44:06.340
Your Highness,

44:07.620 --> 44:08.340
where's Yu Cheng'an?

44:10.460 --> 44:11.020
He lost.

44:15.980 --> 44:20.740
(Next Episode Preview)

44:21.340 --> 44:21.740
Your Highness.

44:22.860 --> 44:23.340
What is it?

44:27.100 --> 44:27.580
Yan Shang,

44:28.580 --> 44:29.620
no matter when,

44:30.460 --> 44:31.900
no matter what happens,

44:33.380 --> 44:34.780
I'll protect you.

44:37.880 --> 44:41.173
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:43.858 --> 44:48.774
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:50.968 --> 44:56.813
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

44:57.313 --> 45:02.539
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:05.308 --> 45:10.099
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:10.935 --> 45:17.014
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:18.815 --> 45:21.965
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:21.965 --> 45:23.613
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:23.665 --> 45:27.389
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:27.767 --> 45:32.433
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:33.052 --> 45:37.093
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:37.584 --> 45:39.699
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:39.739 --> 45:46.685
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:47.448 --> 45:50.901
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:51.081 --> 45:54.226
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

45:54.665 --> 46:01.302
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:01.699 --> 46:03.737
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:03.737 --> 46:06.213
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:06.251 --> 46:08.720
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:08.924 --> 46:15.811
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:16.123 --> 46:19.394
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:19.699 --> 46:22.872
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:23.196 --> 46:26.622
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:26.855 --> 46:30.080
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:30.411 --> 46:37.207
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:37.576 --> 46:39.638
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:39.639 --> 46:42.142
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:42.189 --> 46:44.527
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:44.758 --> 46:51.593
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:51.942 --> 46:53.560
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:53.690 --> 46:55.486
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

46:55.843 --> 46:58.860
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:58.900 --> 47:00.227
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
